 bounds remain unchanged. Four performance cards and21 library notes retain the source-versus-structural distinction.\n\nStacks on OPEN unmerged #179 at exact 43598513e5bccb0e8e9ab3fe92ef43a22ee6638e. Historical #149 already accepted the byte-identical21 public proofs/7 definitions/2 abbreviations and whole74 canary proofs/11 definitions/7 abbreviations. Zero new proofs, definitions, registry nodes or mathematical obligation closures. Fixed exogenous deterministic policies may depend on finite history; randomized/measurable laws, external-parameter independence, executable oracles and anytime tuning remain outside this contract.\n\nValidation: focused3324 jobs,122 standard-only kernel audits,21 unchanged statement guards and32 pre-specified actual VALUE pairs; combined root/Tests{\"root-v1-01\": 9091, \"Tests-v1-01\": 9238} jobs (caches included), full harness466 tests/7 existing skips. Exact-base contributor/scope/shadow and clean local Lean-verified site checks pass, with10817 previous shared IDs/URLs preserved and five current images reviewed. Distinct automated decoder and source CONTRACT/BODY/FINAL reviews discharge R1-R8; requested Astra/medium, no human or runtime attestation. The origin/main diagnostic still fails for nine OTHER required Chapter1 gaps, UNWAIVED.\n\nEvidence: docs/contracts/online-osd-policy-public-v1; runs/online-osd-policy-public-20261007/accepted-decision-v1.json, accepted-binding-audit-v1.json, final-reader-review-v1.md and integrated-gates-overlay-v1.json. PDF SHA256 cef4edfa97a6e063e53e9c532717c50aa156e5bc782ea49f969b3385011a1b17; printed16/19-21, PDF28/31-33. Remaining Example2.32/linearization/unitanalysis/maintext/appendix obligations are required; Chapter2 incomplete, Chapters3-16 unenumerated, whole Goal ACTIVE. No merge/deployment/main/live update or retirement.\n\nPublication-byte repair: original delivery/audit1/diagnostic1/audit2 failures and the rejected metadata review are retained. The first bare-path traceback identifies the raw-SHA assertion (membership would report a tuple); the earlier missing-dictionary annotation was unsupported and is superseded. Actual Git conversion changed bound CRLF receipts to LF. Only this RUN uses local * -text attributes/scoped renormalization to preserve original raw bytes; the captured explicit-head/full-tree audit verifies every current RUN file against actual Git blobs. Corrected delivery metadata separately binds fresh final v2 gates. Source/public/reader/FINAL evidence and exactly one native accepted trial are unchanged; fresh publication audit/metadata review remain required.\n","created_at":"2026-10-07T05:51:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T05:55:22Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4387bbde52d1c962617cf94852212a9c2179f3bd","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/181/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/181/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/issues/181/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DakeBU/Auto-Bandit-RL-Proof-In-Sleep/statuses/8ce8cc580bd7311482dd40234aaf34bd9a909a8b","head":{"label":"DakeBU:codex/research-online-osd-policy-migration","ref":"codex/research-online-osd-policy-migration","sha":"8ce8cc580bd7311482dd40234aaf34bd9a909a8b","user":{"login":"DakeBU","id":159223240,"node_id":"U_kgDOCX2NyA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/159223240?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU","html_url":"https://github.com/DakeBU","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DakeBU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://ap